WEBVTT

00:02:02.431 --> 00:02:03.983
Suvo.

00:02:03.983 --> 00:02:08.215
(Aplauz)

00:02:09.012 --> 00:02:11.658
Publika: Stresti.

00:02:13.429 --> 00:02:15.765
Saviti.

00:02:16.361 --> 00:02:18.939
DžS. Sam se kida. Saviti.
Savijanje je bitno

00:02:18.939 --> 00:02:22.514
jer omogućava bolje upijanje.

00:02:24.471 --> 00:02:26.859
Ne morate zapamtiti ovaj deo,
ali verujte mi.

00:02:26.859 --> 00:02:31.352
(Smeh)